    P=P|mk
    # candidate: dihedral+translate of P s.t. image & S ⊆ mk, image ∩ newMC ⊇ ? try: image \ mk ⊆ union(S colored?) ... 
    # Constraint: every cell of image that lands on a shape cell must be a marker cell there (recolored). All other image cells become mark color (they were bg or marker).
    ok=[]
    for fr in [1,-1]:
